  "tagline": "Indoor sauna cabin, 120 × 120 × 206 cm.",
  "description": "Harvia Urban White Small brings modern clarity into sauna design. The entire front wall is made of tempered safety glass, allowing natural light to open the interior visually, while the exterior walls are finished in white glass for a clean and contemporary look.\n\nThe light aspen interior creates a calm and balanced atmosphere. The rear bench layout keeps the structure simple and functional, offering comfortable seating for two. All wood surfaces are knotless premium quality and designed specifically for sauna use.\n\nHeating options include the elegant Harvia Spirit heater as well as traditional electric and combi models, depending on your preferred steam experience. Operation is handled through the Fenix touch control panel, with optional MyHarvia app connectivity for convenient remote use.\n\nUrban is delivered as a precision-engineered element structure. With a limited number of carefully manufactured wall elements and hidden fittings, installation remains controlled and efficient. Adjustable legs allow fine leveling, and the door’s handedness can be selected during installation for maximum flexibility.\n\nUrban White Small is designed and built in Finland — compact, refined and created for modern living.\n\n• Exterior: Full front clear or gray glass, side and back white or black glass\n• Interior: Aspen or black aspen and heat-treated aspen\n• Benches: Aspen or black aspen\n• Base frame: Adjustable legs on wooden walls\n• Door: Clear or gray 8mm tempered glass door, vertical wooden/steel handle\n• Lighting: RGBW led lighting",
