  "name": "Urban Black Small",
  "brand": "Harvia",
  "tagline": "Indoor sauna cabin, 120 × 120 × 206 cm.",
  "description": "Harvia Urban Black Small expresses modern sauna design with confidence. The front wall is fully glazed, creating openness and a light visual connection to the surrounding space, while the exterior walls are finished in black glass for a bold, architectural look.\n\nInside, dark surfaces and vertical paneling create a focused and intimate atmosphere. The side walls are finished in black, while the rear wall features thermo-treated aspen that brings natural texture to the interior. Black benches complete the minimal and structured layout, offering comfortable seating for two.\n\nThe black interior surfaces are treated with a water-based sauna wax developed for high temperatures. The finish protects the wood while remaining breathable.\n\nYou may choose the Harvia Spirit heater or alternative electric and combi models to shape the steam character to your preference. The Fenix touch control panel ensures intuitive daily use, and MyHarvia connectivity enables remote operation.\n\nUrban Black Small features a precision element construction with concealed fittings for a clean architectural finish. Adjustable legs support accurate installation, and the door handedness can be defined during assembly.\n\nDesigned and built in Finland, Urban Small Black combines compact proportions with confident modern expression.\n\n• Exterior: Full front clear or gray glass, side and back white or black glass\n• Interior: Aspen or black aspen and heat-treated aspen\n• Benches: Aspen or black aspen\n• Base frame: Adjustable legs on wooden walls\n• Door: Clear or gray 8mm tempered glass door, vertical wooden/steel handle\n• Lighting: RGBW led lighting",
