  "category": "saunas-hammam",
  "collection": "sauna-urban",
  "name": "Urban Black Medium",
  "brand": "Harvia",
  "tagline": "Indoor sauna cabin, 160 × 160 × 206 cm.",
  "description": "Harvia Urban Black Medium combines generous space with architectural clarity. The entire front wall is glass, bringing natural light into the cabin, while the exterior walls are finished in black glass to create depth and a strong architectural presence.\n\nInside, dark surfaces and vertical paneling emphasize simplicity and proportion. The side walls are finished in black, while the rear wall features thermo-treated aspen that adds natural texture to the interior. Black benches complete the balanced layout, providing comfortable seating with a calm, focused atmosphere.\n\nAll black surfaces are finished with a water-based sauna wax formulated for sauna environments. The treatment protects the wood, remains breathable.\n\nHeating options include Spirit, traditional electric, combi and pillar heaters. The Fenix touch display provides intuitive control, and MyHarvia connectivity enables flexible remote management.\n\nUrban Black Medium is constructed as a precision element cabin with hidden fittings and adjustable legs for accurate installation. The door handedness can be selected during assembly for maximum flexibility.\n\nDesigned and built in Finland, Urban Medium Black delivers modern heat with architectural precision.\n\n• Exterior: Full front clear or gray glass, side and back white or black glass\n• Interior: Aspen or black aspen and heat-treated aspen\n• Benches: Aspen or black aspen\n• Base frame: Adjustable legs on wooden walls\n• Door: Clear or gray 8mm tempered glass door, vertical wooden/steel handle\n• Lighting: RGBW led lighting",
