  "description": "Harvia Urban White Medium extends the Urban concept into a more generous layout while maintaining its minimalist character. The fully glazed front wall opens the sauna visually, while the exterior walls are finished in white glass for a bright and refined architectural expression.\n\nThe light aspen interior enhances the sense of space, and the rear bench layout keeps the design structured and calm. Knotless premium wood and sauna-proof materials ensure durability and long-term comfort.\n\nIn addition to Spirit and traditional electric heaters, the medium size also allows pillar heater options with larger stone volume. Combi models are available for adjustable humidity. Fenix touch control and optional MyHarvia connectivity provide intuitive and flexible operation.\n\nThe cabin is delivered as a precision element structure engineered for clean installation. Hidden fittings preserve the minimal look, adjustable legs allow accurate leveling, and the door handedness can be selected during installation.\n\nUrban White Medium is designed and built in Finland — modern, practical and refined for everyday relaxation.\n\n• Exterior: Full front clear or gray glass, side and back white or black glass\n• Interior: Aspen or black aspen and heat-treated aspen\n• Benches: Aspen or black aspen\n• Base frame: Adjustable legs on wooden walls\n• Door: Clear or gray 8mm tempered glass door, vertical wooden/steel handle\n• Lighting: RGBW led lighting",
