  "brand": "Harvia",
  "tagline": "Indoor sauna cabin, 173 × 159 × 201 cm.",
  "description": "Harvia Panorama Mini brings classic Finnish sauna feeling into a compact yet well-balanced layout. Vertical spruce paneling creates a natural look, while the element construction supports stable sauna conditions.\n\nThe L-shaped bench design makes efficient use of the space and allows comfortable sitting or relaxed reclining. Linden benches remain pleasant to the touch even as temperatures rise, and the vertical paneling adds subtle rhythm to the interior.\n\nThe clear tempered safety glass front opens the sauna visually and allows light to enter, creating a brighter and more spacious feel despite the compact footprint.\n\nHeating options include traditional electric and combi heaters. Fenix control ensures intuitive operation, and optional MyHarvia connectivity enables convenient remote use.\n\nPanorama Mini is delivered as an element cabin for straightforward assembly. Handedness of benches, heater and glass wall can be selected during installation.\n\nPanorama Mini is compact in size, yet complete in experience.",
