  "description": "Harvia Panorama Small offers a classic sauna atmosphere shaped by natural spruce and thoughtful design details.\n\nThe L-shaped bench layout provides flexible seating and the option to recline comfortably. Slim linden bench boards create a light visual appearance while remaining comfortable even in high heat.\n\nLarge clear tempered safety glass elements open the front visually, bringing brightness into the space. The interplay between vertical wall panels and horizontal bench lines adds depth and character.\n\nHeater options include traditional electric, combi and pillar models. With Fenix touch control and optional MyHarvia connectivity, daily operation remains simple and reliable.\n\nPanorama Small is delivered as a precision-made element cabin. Handedness can be defined during installation to suit your space.\n\nPanorama Small is a practical, warm and inviting sauna for modern homes.\n\n• Made from solid spruce for durability\n• Elegant Interior: \"Prestige\" linden wood interior with three 620 mm wide benches, two headrests, backrests, and a banksight panel.\n• Safety glass door and clear glass elements for a modern look\n• Heater protection grille and floor grid for added safety\n• Optional LED set for color lighting in your cabin",
