 {
  "slug": "block-right-large",
  "category": "saunas-hammam",
  "collection": "sauna-block",
  "name": "Block Right Large",
  "brand": "Harvia",
  "tagline": "Indoor sauna cabin, 198 × 200 × 210 cm.",
  "description": "Harvia Block Right Large creates a bright and structured sauna environment where architecture and warmth meet. The balanced proportions and open glass front establish a calm and refined atmosphere.\n\nThe silk-printed tempered safety glass façade brings natural light into the cabin while reinforcing its architectural presence. Optional glass corner elements can further enhance the sense of openness.\n\nBoth the interior and exterior surfaces are finished in brushed thermo alder, a thermally modified wood known for its stability and warm, refined tone. The L-shaped benches are built with a durable spruce frame and topped with smooth aspen seating boards that remain comfortable even as temperatures rise.\n\nThe cabin structure incorporates a 30 mm high-performance PIR insulation board, designed to deliver strong thermal efficiency in a compact construction. The result is faster heat-up and reliable temperature stability.\n\nBlock is built as a precision element cabin with hidden fittings and pre-planned cable routing. The construction supports a controlled and efficient installation process, whether carried out independently or with the support of a Harvia reseller. Adjustable base legs help ensure accurate positioning.\n\nEvery Block sauna is designed and built in Finland, handcrafted and test-assembled to guarantee safety and precision.\n\nHeating can be tailored to your preference with traditional electric, pillar or combi heater options. The Fenix touch display provides clear control, and MyHarvia integration enables flexible remote operation.\n\nBlock Large combines architectural restraint with dependable Finnish sauna expertise.",
