 {
  "slug": "ventura-large",
  "category": "saunas-hammam",
  "collection": "sauna-ventura",
  "name": "Ventura Large",
  "brand": "Harvia",
  "tagline": "Indoor sauna cabin, 200 × 200 × 210 cm.",
  "description": "Harvia Ventura Large elevates sauna design into a statement of movement and material. The curved benches and backrests are formed from molded ash veneer, flowing together in a continuous and harmonious shape.\n\nAsh veneer combines elegance with durability. It maintains its light tone over time and performs reliably in heat and humidity. The shaped front edges improve seating comfort while highlighting the clean and balanced design of the interior.\n\nThe full glass front enhances the sense of openness and allows natural light to define the interior atmosphere. Black spruce exterior panels create a bold architectural contrast.\n\nA 30 mm PIR insulation structure supports efficient heat retention and consistent performance. The cabin’s element-based construction with hidden fittings ensures precision and visual purity.\n\nThe Harvia Spirit heater is a natural design companion to Ventura, echoing the curved interior and delivering smooth, enveloping steam through its generous stone mass.\n\nAlternative heater options are also available, from traditional electric models to pillar heaters with increased stone capacity or combi versions for added humidity. The Fenix touch display ensures intuitive control, and MyHarvia compatibility allows convenient remote management.\n\nVentura Large is constructed as a robust element-based sauna, engineered for structural stability and precise assembly. The limited number of carefully manufactured wall elements and hidden attachments preserve the clean visual expression of the design.\n\nFine adjustment is supported by integrated adjustable base legs, ensuring accurate alignment during installation. Every Ventura sauna is designed and built in Finland, and each unit is test-assembled prior to delivery to guarantee precision, safety and lasting quality.\n\nVentura Large is a design-forward sauna where form, material and authentic Finnish heat are in harmony.\n\n• Easy installation\n• Ash Ventura panels inside the cabin\n• Streamlined look with full glass front\n• High performance (PIR insulation) for energy efficiency\n• Glass wall made of single pane 0.3 inch tempered glass\n• Ventura benches with high quality ash veneer on top\n• External panels black spruce.\n• Wall thickness ca. 100 mm width\n• Sauna heater sold separately",
