  "tagline": "Sauna cabin with infrared heater and salt wall, 206 × 206 × 204 cm.",
  "description": "The Harvia Himalaya Infra+ sauna cabin has the perfect balance of relaxation and therapeutic benefits. Designed for comfort, efficiency, and ultimate wellness, this sauna is ideal for up to 5 people and offers a range of features that make it the perfect addition to your home or wellness center.\n\nWith its ESG glass door and clear glass elements, this sauna is designed for both function and style. It comes with easy-to-follow assembly instructions and all the necessary materials. The Harvia Himalaya Infra+ sauna is also available as a custom build for personalized solutions.\n\nRelax, rejuvenate, and enjoy the numerous health benefits of a Salt Sauna – from improving circulation to reducing inflammation and promoting skin healing. The Harvia Himalaya Infra+ Sauna is your path to a healthier, more balanced lifestyle.\n\n• Cabin made of solid spruce for durability and a natural look\n• Effective Infrared Heating: Includes a 350W full-spectrum infrared heater (with wooden backrest) to provide a soothing, deep-penetrating heat that enhances relaxation and promotes healing.\n• Salt Therapy Benefits: The sauna’s combination of salt bricks and gentle heat activates the hygroscopic properties of salt, releasing valuable minerals into the air, enhancing your breathing, skin health, and overall well-being.\n• Innovative Lighting: Enhance your sauna experience with the built-in RGBW color-changing lights, easily controlled via a 4-zone remote for a fully customizable ambiance.\n• Luxurious Interior: The interior features Lindenwood benches (620 mm), headrests, backrests, ventilation sliders, and a bank sight cover, all designed for maximum comfort during your sauna sessions.",
