  "brand": "Harvia",
  "tagline": "Indoor sauna cabin, 214 × 210 × 201 cm.",
  "description": "Harvia Panorama Large combines generous proportions with natural materials for comfortable shared sauna sessions. Vertical spruce paneling shapes the interior and creates a calm, welcoming atmosphere, while the element structure supports steady sauna performance.\n\nThe L-shaped bench design allows both upright seating and comfortable reclining. Slim linden bench boards feel pleasant against the skin and maintain a light, elegant appearance.\n\nThe clear tempered safety glass front enhances openness and creates a brighter atmosphere. Subtle variations in panel thickness and orientation add character without overwhelming the traditional look.\n\nHeating options include traditional electric, combi and pillar heaters, allowing you to tailor the steam intensity to your preference. Fenix control ensures intuitive daily use, with optional MyHarvia app connectivity for remote planning.\n\nPanorama Large is delivered as an element cabin designed for efficient assembly. During installation, the handedness of the benches, heater and glass wall can be chosen according to the space.\n\nPanorama Large offers generous space, natural materials and reliable Finnish heat.\n\n• Made from solid spruce for durability\n• Elegant Interior: \"Prestige\" linden wood interior with three 620 mm wide benches, two headrests, backrests, and a banksight panel.\n• Safety glass door and clear glass elements for a modern look\n• Heater protection grille and floor grid for added safety\n• Optional LED set for color lighting in your cabin",
